Subject: [PATCH] feat(legal-kb-schema): knowledge-base schema, strict loader
 and temporal lookup (step 4a)

- new pure module legal-kb-schema (depends only on shared-types): documents, articles,
  half-open [validFrom, validTo) versions, relations, rulings, provenance/review
- loadCorpus: strict unknown->Corpus validation with exact paths, canonical + idempotent output
- resolveCitation / versionsInForceAt: explicit temporal lookup (found, gap, not-yet, no-longer, unknown-*)
- fictional sample corpus only; no real legal data
- /kb-schema workbench; ADR-0003; task 0006; handoff 0005; mutation script
- 89 new tests (378 total + 16 todo); fuzz found+fixed sparse-array bug
